  "notes": [
    "Roadmap overlay 5 of 6. Requires overlay 4 v1 exact source state.",
    "Adds page selector/navigation, selected-only filtering, optional page grouping, source-host and XenForo post-ID card metadata.",
    "Introduces six function-boundary source modules and deterministic builder that reproduces the single self-contained userscript byte-for-byte.",
    "Adds dedicated XenForo fixture plus scanner/cache, network resilience, gallery navigation, and ZIP/archive contract tests.",
    "Root scripts: build:lpsg, check:lpsg, test:lpsg; build:userscripts now regenerates LPSG.",
    "Audit pass 1 caught and corrected a stale scanner-signature test contract.",
    "Audit pass 2 strengthened source/post metadata and checked selection-cache invalidation/navigation behavior.",
    "Audit pass 3 corrected module boundaries so no function is split between source modules; reproducibility and all tests pass."
  ]
